msgid "Scene thumbnails while hovering the player's progress bar."
msgstr "Scene thumbnails while hovering the player's progress bar."

#: src/routes/admin/settings/+page.svelte
msgid "Seek-bar thumbnails"
msgstr "Seek-bar thumbnails"

#: src/routes/admin/settings/+page.svelte
msgid "The device holding a file renders its thumbnails (in the background, or the first time the title is played) and keeps them cached; <0>Regenerate trickplay thumbnails</0> on the Devices page re-checks a whole library. Turn this off to spare weak devices; a single device can also opt out with <1>FINDERELLA_TRICKPLAY=0</1>."
msgstr "The device holding a file renders its thumbnails (in the background, or the first time the title is played) and keeps them cached; <0>Regenerate trickplay thumbnails</0> on the Devices page re-checks a whole library. Turn this off to spare weak devices; a single device can also opt out with <1>FINDERELLA_TRICKPLAY=0</1>."

#: src/routes/admin/settings/+page.svelte
msgid "Generate in the background"
msgstr "Generate in the background"

#: src/routes/admin/settings/+page.svelte
msgid "Render thumbnails for newly scanned files right away, then work through older files that don't have them yet — one file at a time per device, at low priority. While Trickplay is on but this option is off, a video without thumbnails gets them on demand the first time someone plays it."
msgstr "Render thumbnails for newly scanned files right away, then work through older files that don't have them yet — one file at a time per device, at low priority. While Trickplay is on but this option is off, a video without thumbnails gets them on demand the first time someone plays it."

