#: src/routes/admin/settings/+page.svelte
msgid "Use the GPU for transcoding"
msgstr "Use the GPU for transcoding"

#: src/routes/admin/settings/+page.svelte
msgid "Devices decode and encode transcodes on their GPU (NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, Apple, Raspberry Pi 4) when they have one that passed their startup check, which leaves the CPU free for more streams. Anything the GPU can't handle, or a GPU that can't start a transcode, falls back to the CPU. Turn this off to transcode everything on the CPU. Applies to transcodes started after the change; the Devices page shows which GPU each device found."
msgstr "Devices decode and encode transcodes on their GPU (NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, Apple, Raspberry Pi 4) when they have one that passed their startup check, which leaves the CPU free for more streams. Anything the GPU can't handle, or a GPU that can't start a transcode, falls back to the CPU. Turn this off to transcode everything on the CPU. Applies to transcodes started after the change; the Devices page shows which GPU each device found."

